id: pm-rl-evalplans
title: Enforce predeclared causal evaluation plans at promotion
description: "Declare target populations, correlation units, sample sizes and fixed stopping rules before experiments. Bind plan identity and clustered observations to comparison and generation promotion."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-21T21:36:09.182Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T21:47:38.384Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-24T21:47:38.368Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-24T21:47:38.368Z"
author: codex-agent
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Synthetic correlated cohorts cannot masquerade as independent samples; changed plans invalidate comparison identity. Typed SDK and CLI; compact TOON/JSON; typed refusals with remedies; README and example; non-git real public-tracker validation; npm and Bun CI release gates.
parent: pm-rl-apvf
resolution: Promotion binds predeclared causal plans and independent cohort structure; changed plans invalidate comparison identity and correlated cohorts cannot inflate sample counts.
expected_result: Synthetic correlated cohorts cannot masquerade as independent samples; changed plans invalidate comparison identity. Typed SDK and CLI; compact TOON/JSON; typed refusals with remedies; README and example; non-git real public-tracker validation; npm and Bun CI release gates.
