comments[35]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T21:36:11.512Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked against the pinned CLI SDK declarations and sibling package sources/docs: core Plan/Decision stores decisions but has no causal experiment-plan enforcement; pm-jev owns model calibration/evaluation; pm-context supplies context. Existing pm-rl-rsipower supplies one powered dataset and is retained separately. This item adds reusable immutable plan/comparison enforcement and cluster-aware promotion, stacked on PR #94; must merge after #94. Dependency pins remain unchanged. Local verification will be targeted tests, typecheck and lint; full npm/Bun release gates run in CI due shared CPU load."
  "2026-10-21T21:49:50.172Z",codex-agent,"Implemented fixed paired plans in core Plan records, immutable result Decisions, provenance-pinned comparison identities, and authoritative promotion enforcement. Plans pin incumbent provenance, populations, member-to-unit assignments, sample sizes, fixed stopping, objective and criterion. Equal-unit aggregation counts correlated cohorts once; one sealed result per plan. Existing unplanned controllers retain legacy semantics without causal-plan claims. Non-git public validation measured 95 observations as one repository unit: candidate 0.7684210526 vs incumbent 0.2315789474; naive episode-count gate would promote, clustered gate refuses. Read-only public source digest is unchanged; evidence is descriptive replay, not deployed causal benefit."
